        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Seed of Chucky, Child's Play 3, Bride of Chucky, The Wind in the Willows\n- Projects: Child's Play series\n- People: Keith-Lee Castle\n- Concepts: supernatural comedy slasher films, supernatural slasher films\n\nFacts:\n- Child's Play 3 is a 1991 American supernatural slasher film.\n- The Wind in the Willows is a 1996 film based on the popular book.\n- Bride of Chucky was released in 1998.\n- Seed of Chucky is a 2004 American supernatural comedy slasher film.\n- Seed of Chucky is the fifth installment of the Child's Play series.\n- Seed of Chucky is a sequel to Bride of Chucky.\n- Keith-Lee Castle played the owner of the doll, described as the psychotic Psychs, in Seed of Chucky.\n- Keith-Lee Castle played Clarence Weasel in The Wind in the Willows.",
